{"id":9019779,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/merge_requests/4579","number":4579,"state":"merged","title":"fix: 修复 ReduceStdV2Update 多路径精度异常","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/4579","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/4579/issues","body":"## 描述\n\nReduceStdV2Update 的 Arch35 kernel 存在两类精度问题：\n\n- AscendC::Reg::UpdateMask 会通过引用自动更新剩余元素数，原实现又手工递减一次，导致处理超过单轮 64 个 FP32 元素时重复扣减，后续数据被跳过。\n- FP16/BF16 group tail-A 路径按 FP32 而非输入 dtype 计算 cache 到 workspace 的源步长，造成部分输出读取 padding 数据并错误变为 0。\n\n本 PR 移除 normal/empty kernel 中 UpdateMask 后的重复递减，按输入 dtype 恢复 tail-A 对齐步长，并将 GEIR 示例扩展到 128 个输入元素以覆盖跨 64 元素 mask 边界。\n\n## 关联的Issue\n\nhttps://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/issues/2593\n\n## 测试\n\n- Ascend950 package 构建通过，覆盖 FP16、FP32、BF16。\n- 最新 ops-test-kit e559b7f1：210/210 Golden 精度 PASS、内存越界检查 PASS、性能状态 PASS。\n- 问题用例 wb_reduce_std_v2_update_0165、wb_reduce_std_v2_update_0201 定向回归 PASS。\n- GEIR 方差、标准差回归 2/2 PASS。\n- Host UT 9/9 PASS。\n- pre-commit、clang-format、codespell、OAT 全部通过。\n- 冒烟已过\n## 文档更新\n\n不涉及对外文档更新；仅扩展 GEIR 回归示例的测试规模。\n\n## 类型标签\n\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n","assignees_number":14,"assignees":[{"id":"68777000fc42115893ad8b8c","login":"songkai111","name":"songkai111","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/songkai111","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"682accc0a6508e17e040cd22","login":"zhangzijie","name":"zhangzijie","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhangzijie","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822dffae4b985165b4b112b","login":"loov1","name":"loov","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/loov1","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68d10be46073b92eb7722836","login":"zhanw_coding","name":"zhanw_coding","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/af/1b59fa26fc66d8f2fb2c2ae63bb567faa986617b7b8600ad716afe7696d65511.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhanw_coding","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"acce